      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "metadata {\n   messageId, messageType \u2190 the ONLY source of truth for consumers,\n   occurredAt, source, correlationId, causationId }\noutboundEmailId        \u2190 Kafka key: keeps one email's events ordered\naggregateVersion       \u2190 1,2,3\u2026 : spot duplicates and gaps\nrequestId \u00b7 reference  \u2190 credit-subscription:application:APP-2026-00123\ncategory               \u2190 TRANSACTIONAL | REGULATORY | MARKETING\ncontent { sender, recipients, subject, body, attachments[] }\ndispatchStatus \u00b7 attempts \u00b7 queuedAt \u00b7 deliveries[]\npayload: union [ Queued | Rejected | Sent | DeliveryFailed | Delivered | Bounced ]",
      "originalText": "metadata {\n   messageId, messageType \u2190 the ONLY source of truth for consumers,\n   occurredAt, source, correlationId, causationId }\noutboundEmailId        \u2190 Kafka key: keeps one email's events ordered\naggregateVersion       \u2190 1,2,3\u2026 : spot duplicates and gaps\nrequestId \u00b7 reference  \u2190 credit-subscription:application:APP-2026-00123\ncategory               \u2190 TRANSACTIONAL | REGULATORY | MARKETING\ncontent { sender, recipients, subject, body, attachments[] }\ndispatchStatus \u00b7 attempts \u00b7 queuedAt \u00b7 deliveries[]\npayload: union [ Queued | Rejected | Sent | DeliveryFailed | Delivered | Bounced ]",
