      "boundElements": null,
      "updated": 1790005987766,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REGULATORY   SECCI \u00b7 ESIS \u00b7 contract copy \u00b7 rate-change notice\n             must be delivered AND evidenced;\n             a marketing opt-out never blocks it\nTRANSACTIONAL  application received \u00b7 documents missing \u00b7 decision ready\nMARKETING      Campaign offers \u2014 needs consent, honours unsubscribes\n\nHard bounce blocks every category (the mailbox does not exist).\nAn unsubscribe blocks MARKETING only.",
      "originalText": "REGULATORY   SECCI \u00b7 ESIS \u00b7 contract copy \u00b7 rate-change notice\n             must be delivered AND evidenced;\n             a marketing opt-out never blocks it\nTRANSACTIONAL  application received \u00b7 documents missing \u00b7 decision ready\nMARKETING      Campaign offers \u2014 needs consent, honours unsubscribes\n\nHard bounce blocks every category (the mailbox does not exist).\nAn unsubscribe blocks MARKETING only.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true
