      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "BACKWARD              new schema reads previous version's data       add defaulted field, delete field      consumers first\nBACKWARD_TRANSITIVE   \u2026 reads ALL earlier versions' data             same                                   consumers first     \u2190  ours\nFORWARD               previous version reads new data                add any field, delete defaulted field   producers first\nFULL / FULL_TRANSITIVE  both directions                              add/delete defaulted fields only        either\nNONE                  no check                                       anything                                \u2014",
      "originalText": "BACKWARD              new schema reads previous version's data       add defaulted field, delete field      consumers first\nBACKWARD_TRANSITIVE   \u2026 reads ALL earlier versions' data             same                                   consumers first     \u2190  ours\nFORWARD               previous version reads new data                add any field, delete defaulted field   producers first\nFULL / FULL_TRANSITIVE  both directions                              add/delete defaulted fields only        either\nNONE                  no check                                       anything                                \u2014",
      "fontSize": 14,
